WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.704 --> 00:00:10.413
Hi, I am a balloon.

2
00:00:11.133 --> 00:00:13.716
Have you ever wondered where balloons come from?

3
00:00:14.556 --> 00:00:16.798
Well, today is your lucky day.

4
00:00:17.519 --> 00:00:20.421
I am going to give you a tour of a balloon factory.

5
00:00:21.222 --> 00:00:22.023
Come with me!

6
00:00:24.485 --> 00:00:25.866
Look at all these colors.

7
00:00:26.707 --> 00:00:31.202
In this factory, they make 25 different colored balloons.

8
00:00:31.983 --> 00:00:35.085
Do you think you can name 25 different colors?

9
00:00:36.045 --> 00:00:36.606
Try it!

10
00:00:36.906 --> 00:00:37.887
It's not easy.

11
00:00:40.128 --> 00:00:41.289
Where should I begin?

12
00:00:42.210 --> 00:00:45.031
I guess the best place to start is at the beginning.

13
00:00:45.912 --> 00:00:51.476
In this room, the workers prepare all the ingredients that we need to make balloons.

14
00:00:55.078 --> 00:00:57.420
This white goo is called latex.

15
00:00:58.060 --> 00:01:00.141
This is what all balloons are made of.

16
00:01:00.782 --> 00:01:03.803
It doesn't have any color yet, but it soon will.

17
00:01:09.086 --> 00:01:10.967
Now let's go to the production line.

18
00:01:11.548 --> 00:01:14.789
This is where the gooey mixture is turned into balloons.

19
00:01:15.690 --> 00:01:26.416
In this factory, they make many kinds of balloons: long balloons, round balloons, small balloons, and multicolored balloons.

20
00:01:28.072 --> 00:01:29.773
Let's look at some of the machines.

21
00:01:30.634 --> 00:01:33.016
This machine gives each balloon its shape.

22
00:01:33.877 --> 00:01:37.179
This machine heats the balloons until they are dry.

23
00:01:38.260 --> 00:01:42.983
Then, that machine removes the balloons and puts them into bins.

24
00:01:44.705 --> 00:01:46.586
This is a big factory.

25
00:01:47.026 --> 00:01:50.469
Can you guess how many balloons it makes each day?

26
00:01:51.290 --> 00:01:52.170
One thousand?

27
00:01:52.851 --> 00:01:54.092
One hundred thousand?

28
00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:58.711
This factory makes one million balloons a day!

29
00:02:02.555 --> 00:02:03.575
Oh no!

30
00:02:04.316 --> 00:02:08.359
One of the machines is broken and the production line has stopped.

31
00:02:09.240 --> 00:02:10.781
This is very bad.

32
00:02:11.422 --> 00:02:12.423
But not to worry!

33
00:02:12.883 --> 00:02:15.485
The repairman will fix it in just a minute.

34
00:02:19.609 --> 00:02:21.690
The repairman must work fast.

35
00:02:22.491 --> 00:02:27.159
If he doesn't, people may not have balloons for their birthdays or picnics.

36
00:02:29.420 --> 00:02:32.863
In this factory, all the balloons must be perfect.

37
00:02:33.744 --> 00:02:36.926
This woman makes sure that every balloon is good.

38
00:02:37.687 --> 00:02:43.571
She makes sure the color, weight, and shape of each balloon is just right.

39
00:02:44.952 --> 00:02:47.754
The next room is very bright and colorful.

40
00:02:48.274 --> 00:02:50.116
Look at all the balloons!

41
00:02:50.696 --> 00:02:53.777
Here the workers stamp words onto the balloons.

42
00:02:54.637 --> 00:02:57.438
She is stamping "Happy Birthday."

43
00:02:58.278 --> 00:03:01.919
Over there, he is stamping "Happy Halloween."

44
00:03:04.040 --> 00:03:04.900
Last stop!

45
00:03:05.460 --> 00:03:10.282
In this room, the workers sort the balloons and put them into small bags.

46
00:03:11.382 --> 00:03:13.663
The men put the balloons onto the truck.

47
00:03:14.483 --> 00:03:17.084
The balloons are ready to go to the stores.

48
00:03:22.627 --> 00:03:26.813
Well, I had fun telling you all about the balloon factory.

49
00:03:27.574 --> 00:03:28.996
I hope you had fun too!
